# CSC492 Core

- Read `context.md` before large changes; update `task.md` when a task completes.
- Planner writes `plan.md` only; Actor implements `plan.md` then deletes it.
- Keep `/dashboard` (Next.js read) and `/control-plane` (FastAPI write) decoupled.
- Shared DB via Supabase PostgreSQL; do not invent a new API layer between them unless asked.
- Never commit secrets. Never weaken webhook HMAC or OPA fail-closed behavior.
